==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Enma]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam meatshields until you have enough money to deploy [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] and [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Apple Cat]]. After you kill the first Shy Boy, upgrade your [[Worker Cat]] and spam everything. The One Horns will give you plenty of money to do so.

